Cell[BoxData["\<\"Found 205(51) zero(nonzero) sectors out of 256.\\n    \
ZeroSectors[borsalino] \[LongDash] zero sectors,\\n    \
NonZeroSectors[borsalino] \[LongDash] nonzero sectors,\\n    \
SimpleSectors[borsalino] \[LongDash] simple sectors (no nonzero \
subsectors),\\n    BasisSectors[borsalino] \[LongDash] basis sectors (at \
least one immediate subsector is zero),\\n    ZerojRule[borsalino] \
\[LongDash] a rule to nullify all zero j[borsalino\[Ellipsis]],\\n    \
CutDs[borsalino] \[LongDash] a flag list of cut denominators (1=cut).\"\>"], \
